{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/894708-will-there-be-a-changeling-translation-guide","id":894708,"title":"Will there be a Changeling Translation Guide?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-20T07:31:46-07:00","id":894708,"title":"Will there be a Changeling Translation Guide?","content":"Since they're coming out with Changeling: The Dreaming 20th, and Changeling: The Lost 2e, I was wondering if there will be a translation guide, like how Demon: The Fallen and Demon: The Descent have a translation guide. I don't know much about OWOD Changeling, so I'm just curious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T08:20:51-07:00","id":894732,"title":"","content":"I hope so, but it would be hard. Old world changelings are closer to charlatans than anything (technically, fae souls that have replaced/merged with human ones so they are better protected from the Banality of the world). Old!Kiths are have a specific subset of powers/themes/looks and there's a lot of them, though some are more broad than others (Pooka, Knockers, Sluagh, Sidhe, and Trolls map pretty closely to Beasts, Wizened, Darklings, Fairest, and Ogres; Redcaps and Satyrs are more like Gristlegrinders and Dearhearts; I have no idea how to map Eshu or Boggin, and there's like fifty more from the splat books). Old!Seemings, on the other hand, are age-based (though C20 may be changing that) and directly tie into your Glamour and Banality. Glamour being permanent magicness, like Wyrd, and Banality being how much of your magic has worn away, which really has no analog but maybe you could link it to Clarity? The magic system is closer to Geist than to Changeling (pick things you can effect and how you effect them, mix and match). Glamour and gathering it are similar enough, probably, and old!Courts are a heck of a lot simpler (Seelie and Unseelie).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}